{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的长句比X更费眼，而且删减了不少逐拍出现的音乐细节和细微感受变化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然需要多读一些字，但补足了人物行为背后的动机和心理转折，例如为什么想表白、为什么被看出喜欢后反而不安、为什么从期待未来转向接受无法保证永远。这些补充让人物的心理变化更容易理解，前后也形成了更完整的因果链。X的关键词突出、音乐细节丰富，尤其适合快速扫读和捕捉细微的音乐变化，但部分感受短语过密、重复，容易让局部感受盖过叙事主线。综合而言，Y更能让普通观众理解并跟住整段故事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "489375ce-617d-4a4a-8f8b-2b61bcd7f397", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T223231036480Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:33:47.064456+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5331830e6b211cb0e8ffb8da249eb164aa1b4e22c8c30f9f197e575945d1d1e6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment